      "content": "SP 81 SE            HALTON                 HALTON VILLAGE                                            east side 5/78                                       No.6. II Small house, C19,possibly with older fabric, flint with red brick dressings, tiled roof, with hipped sides and half-hipped gable to RH, smaller gable with bargeboard to LH. 2 storeys, open gabled porch with tiled roof over modern door, 2 bays of 3-light wood casements with segmental arched heads except upper LH window. Incised plaster panel above RH window showing foresters at work. Listing NGR: SP8734810198"
    }
